    "body": "## Summary\n\nRemoves the obsolete blocking model-selector handshake from the active Asynchronia plugin policy for ordinary Codex engineering.\n\nPR #395 established that ordinary work uses configured Codex agent-team/model routing and must not require `INVENTORY_OK`, a user model/effort handshake, `CONTINUE`, `WAITING_FOR_MODEL_SELECTION`, or `IMPLEMENTATION_ALLOWED`. The plugin's active model-selector skill and default prompt had drifted back to a blocking CLI preflight, even though `tools/run-asynchronia-model-preflight.py` is absent from current main.\n\n## Policy changes\n\n- Ordinary tasks use configured Codex routing; the missing legacy launcher does not block work.\n- Removed universal selector requirements from task-router and acceptance-pipeline-controller.\n- Kept selector inventory and official cost authority as reference material.\n- Kept specialized numbered-bridge selector routing conditional on current primary bridge authority.\n- Preserved scope isolation/collision checks, security guidance, lock/readiness, PR/CI requirements, UI/game-logic separation, and user-owned Safari acceptance.\n\n## Changed files\n\n- `plugins/asynchronia/.codex-plugin/plugin.json`\n- `plugins/asynchronia/skills/model-selector/SKILL.md`\n- `plugins/asynchronia/skills/task-router/SKILL.md`\n- `plugins/asynchronia/skills/acceptance-pipeline-controller/SKILL.md`\n- `plugins/asynchronia/skills/pipeline-state-and-resume-contract/SKILL.md`\n- `tools/test_asynchronia_plugin_model_routing_policy.py`\n\nNo runtime mirrors or product/runtime files changed.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Focused plugin policy regression: 7/7 PASS.\n- Orchestration policy validator: PASS.\n- Existing orchestration policy tests: PASS.\n- Inventory maintenance tests: 9/9 PASS; inventory and pricing files unchanged.\n- AI work pipeline unit tests: 15/15 PASS.\n- Plugin manifest JSON parse: PASS.\n- `git diff --check`: PASS.\n- `tools/validate_ai_work_pipeline.py`: FAILS on 15 pre-existing archived task-record errors; identical errors reproduced on clean baseline `0d9dd246bb37444bf5073363c4e499393f0b80ff`. The failures concern missing/malformed `.ai-work` archival records, not model-preflight policy.\n\nGitHub CI: pending after PR creation.\n\n## Identity\n\n- Base: `main@0d9dd246bb37444bf5073363c4e499393f0b80ff`\n- Branch: `codex/remove-obsolete-model-preflight-20261014`\n- HEAD: `2baf4af4825c20fe436a5d02034d34eac8341f6b`\n\nDraft only. Do not merge.",
